essages, database tables and display content.</p>","DurationUnit":"day"},{"TaskID":7,"TaskName":"Prototype sensors, irrigation and local display","StartDate":"2026-10-07T06:00:00.000Z","EndDate":"2026-10-09T15:00:00.000Z","Duration":3,"Predecessor":null,"resources":[],"Progress":0,"color":"160","info":"<p>Read sensors, show values on the OLED and try the pump with low-water protection.</p>","DurationUnit":"day"},{"TaskID":8,"TaskName":"Test prototype and data connection","StartDate":"2026-10-08T06:00:00.000Z","EndDate":"2026-10-09T15:00:00.000Z","Duration":2,"Predecessor":null,"resources":[],"Progress":0,"color":"160","info":"<p>Check sensor readings and pump behaviour. Send a reading from the ESP32 through MQTT to the backend and database.</p>","DurationUnit":"day"}]},{"TaskID":9,"TaskName":"Week 3 - Realization and testing","StartDate":"2026-10-12T06:00:00.000Z","EndDate":"2026-10-16T15:00:00.000Z","Duration":5,"Predecessor":null,"resources":[],"Progress":0,"color":"35","info":"<p>Weekly work window. Subtasks share the available time; bar length is not full-time effort.</p>","DurationUnit":"day","subtasks":[{"TaskID":10,"TaskName":"Complete firmware and backend","StartDate":"2026-10-12T06:00:00.000Z","EndDate":"2026-10-15T15:00:00.000Z","Duration":4,"Predecessor":null,"resources":[],"Progress":0,"color":"35","info":"<p>Finish local irrigation, fault handling and the Node.js backend. Keep essential device functions working without the server.</p>","DurationUnit":"day"},{"TaskID":11,"TaskName":"Connect storage, dashboard and alerts","StartDate":"2026-10-13T06:00:00.000Z","EndDate":"2026-10-16T15:00:00.000Z","Duration":4,"Predecessor":null,"resources":[],"Progress":0,"color":"35","info":"<p>Connect PostgreSQL, Grafana, current readings, history, watering events and alerts.</p>","DurationUnit":"day"},{"TaskID":12,"TaskName":"Test integration and update documents","StartDate":"2026-10-14T06:00:00.000Z","EndDate":"2026-10-16T15:00:00.000Z","Duration":3,"Predecessor":nul